|---------------------------|
| BMP5XX-SPI                |
|---------------------------|
| An async SPI driver for   |
| BMP5XX in Rust.           |
|---------------------------|
=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=

This is a quick and dirty Rust port of the Adafruit C++ library for interfacing
with BMP5XX sensors over SPI using `embedded-hal-async` since the other async
Rust driver for BMP5XX only supports I2C. Compatible with `no_std`.

=== References
==============

https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit_BMP5xx
https://cdn-shop.adafruit.com/product-files/6413/bst-bmp585-ds003.pdf